    "Scan of the 1957 edition of the Clarksville, Maryland, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers. Surveyed in 1943; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1957; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1989.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.8 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
